      "id": "claim_a4131d8a160f4a85a8b3489739f0ddc0",
      "statement": "Per-file exceptions are caught in sort_images' as_completed loop and counted as failures with the offending path; one corrupted file never aborts the run, which test_error_summary_and_exit_code and test_cli_exit_code_end_to_end verify end to end (exit code 1 only when failure_count > 0).",
