    {
      "id": "claim_4c3554973f854ce9a8ba1a8edfa05b6e",
      "statement": "rotate_image_according_to_exif re-opens the destination file, applies the rotation implied by the EXIF Orientation value (3 -> 180°, 6 -> 270°, 8 -> 90°, expand=True) and saves back to the same path; rotation happens only after shutil.copy2 so the source is never modified, and in dry-run mode process_image only reads and logs the would-be rotation.",
