    {
      "id": "claim_82c124fe18254c3299715f40db6c05b5",
      "statement": "process_image computes the source-relative directory with os.path.relpath(os.path.dirname(file_path), basepath) and passes it to add_relative_path_tag, which appends 'RelativePath:<value>' to the EXIF UserComment of .jpg/.jpeg files via piexif; other supported formats are copied but never tagged, and OSError, piexif.InvalidImageDataError, or struct.error is re-raised so tagging failure counts as a file failure.",
