      "statement": "Within a destination date folder, process_image keeps the original basename if free, otherwise appends _1, _2, ... numeric suffixes; test_process_image_handles_duplicate_filenames verifies two same-named files with different content both survive as test.jpg and test_1.jpg in 2024/06/15 with distinct pixel content.",
