      "id": "claim_fe261871ba1a4ebe9a4783e28dc0b95e",
      "statement": "setup_logging configures the root logger with the thread-aware format '%(asctime)s - [Thread %(thread)d] - %(levelname)s - %(message)s', which is why per-file log lines from worker threads identify their originating thread.",
