    {
      "id": "claim_000af20759804a44ba8c1241eeba2f7e",
      "statement": "get_exif_orientation is a total metadata lookup: it returns the raw EXIF Orientation value when present and returns None when the image has no EXIF block or lookup raises AttributeError, KeyError, IndexError, or TypeError, allowing the rotation stage to proceed without a rewrite when orientation is unavailable.",
