      "statement": "The rotate-and-save rewrite does not explicitly copy, restore, or strip EXIF in the application, and the repository has no test establishing that orientation metadata survives Pillow's rewrite; metadata retention is therefore implementation behavior dependent on Pillow rather than a tested application invariant.",
