    {
      "id": "claim_4a65da8d2a2d462d8bbf95281078f649",
      "statement": "The numeric filename suffix rule is implemented with separate existence checks for the date folder and destination path, without locks or name reservations, so concurrent workers targeting the same date folder and basename are not guaranteed to receive distinct names; the focused duplicate-name test exercises sequential processing and does not cover this race.",
